[00:42.14]1. Sing to Jehovah. His great name is highly exalted.
[00:47.14]His proud Egyptian foes, He has cast into the sea.
[00:52.14]Praise Jah Almighty;
[00:57.14]Besides him there can be no other.
[01:02.43]Jehovah is his name;
[01:22.72]He has gained the victory.
[01:25.72](Chorus)
[01:28.72]Jehovah God, Most High over all,
[01:31.72]The one who is forevermore the same,
[01:35.38]You soon will cause your enemies to fall
[01:39.05]And sanctify your holy name.
[01:57.79]2. See now all nations Opposing the Sov’reign, Jehovah.
[02:07.23]Though mightier than Pharaoh,
[02:10.83]They too will suffer shame.
[02:16.44]Judgment awaits them;
[02:21.44]They cannot escape Armageddon.
[02:26.44]Soon ev’ryone will know
[02:33.93]That Jehovah is God’s name.
[02:41.41](Chorus)
[02:48.90]Jehovah God, Most High over all,
[02:56.38]The one who is forevermore the same,
[03:03.87]You soon will cause your enemies to fall
[03:11.35]And sanctify your holy name.